</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/extras/6e7632081178eeb443556b32af36c388.webp?t=1771419166\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/extras/5e2bb937c2432b3ec05e491b89dd2c42.poster.avif?t=1771419166\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/extras/5e2bb937c2432b3ec05e491b89dd2c42.webm?t=1771419166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/extras/5e2bb937c2432b3ec05e491b89dd2c42.mp4?t=1771419166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character in your band has a limited amount of action points to use each turn.  Using melee performances for music haters builds up your heat resource, which when done artfully leads to a massive amount of points and the coveted S+ rank.  Convert haters, reach the goal, collect objectives, and survive through increasingly wild encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/extras/d6525b07ca8be5c4252c778180569a47.poster.avif?t=1771419166\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/extras/d6525b07ca8be5c4252c778180569a47.webm?t=1771419166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/extras/d6525b07ca8be5c4252c778180569a47.mp4?t=1771419166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ea