et. The suburban Washington D.C. area is reflected in diner parking lots, shopping malls, and dive bars.  Reminiscent of media such as The Commitments, Airheads, Heathers, and My So-Called Life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/extras/75a52a54f158a8f7003fbba4c6c32b1a.poster.avif?t=1771419166\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/extras/75a52a54f158a8f7003fbba4c6c32b1a.webm?t=1771419166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/extras/75a52a54f158a8f7003fbba4c6c32b1a.mp4?t=1771419166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful cast of supporting characters, both friends and foes join Diane as she struggles with bullying, imperfection, and obsession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/extras/fbb27dc38269d455bc8f3f1ea63d3383.avif?t=1771419166\" width=616 height=497 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/extras/42e2d4f517d559dc7b57e49152c8e79c.avif?t=1771419166\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/extras_big/42e2d4f517d559dc7b57e49152c8e79c.avif?t=1771419166 width=800 height=66 /></span></p>","developers":["Ichigoichie"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389400/d41c0c7ad24923c3267a2080ea30e920e58d8cdd/header.jpg?t=1771419166","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u0